5
00:00:33,826 --> 00:00:38,908
[SPEAKER_00]: But why and how does having fewer wishes aid in understanding the dhamma?

6
00:00:40,208 --> 00:00:49,451
[SPEAKER_01]: It's basically aligning your way of living with the

