[SPEAKER_01]: So, actually, developing understanding is on the level of starting to actually align your life with those principles that are that are spoken of.

12
00:01:36,013 --> 00:01:45,917
[SPEAKER_01]: So, like having fewer wishes, for example, or being content with little, not being greedy, being

13
00:01:48,671 --> 00:02:05,117
[SPEAKER_01]: relatively minimalistic, or having a simple life, it's aligned with the with the practice of dhamma, because it's already going to be developing your mind in having less proliferation of greed, not being... not just reacting to

