15
00:02:10,001 --> 00:02:20,790
[SPEAKER_01]: So, like, in this case, for example, that monk, he could quite well have felt justified in saying, oh, well, I'd missed my lunch, and I was, you know, and I'm hungry, and now somebody's offering me food.

16
00:02:22,752 --> 00:02:28,337
[SPEAKER_01]: And... but he actually chose to prioritize

17
