21
00:03:18,286 --> 00:03:19,167
[SPEAKER_01]: Do I really need it?

22
00:03:19,527 --> 00:03:21,168
[SPEAKER_01]: Do I really have to have it?

23
00:03:21,308 --> 00:03:22,709
[SPEAKER_01]: Is it absolutely essential?

24
00:03:23,230 --> 00:03:23,650
[SPEAKER_01]: And so,

25
00:03:25,088 --> 00:03:35,255
[SPEAKER_01]: Obviously, that then doesn't mean that, you know, in this case, this monk, that day he went hungry, and obviously, in that case, it was for right reasons.

26
00:03:35,275 --> 00:03:40,499
[SPEAKER_01]: It was for to train himself in becoming content, even when, you know,

27
00:03:40,819 --> 00:03:49,962
